[
  {"comment": "Emboss's Taper Angle (mitcad#1547) on OCCT. A rod: a circle of diameter 50 (Sketch1, F1) extruded 40 up the Z axis (F2): 625 pi 40."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_circle", "sketch": "F1", "center": [0, 0], "diameter": 50},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 40}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F2.b0", "volume": 78539.81633974483}},

  {"comment": "Sketch2 (F3) on XZ (normal +Y, sketch y along -Z), through the axis: a 10 x 10 square from z = 15 to 25, wrapped onto the rod and raised 45 to the radius 70 (Emboss1, F4). Without a taper its top is 10 * 70 / 25 = 28 wide around the axis (c1, an arc) and 10 along it (c2), and it adds 100 (70^2 - 25^2) / 50 = 8550."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": "xz"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F3", "corner": [-5, -25], "width": 10, "height": 10},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "emboss",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "face": {"body": "F2.b0", "face": "F2:side(c1)"}, "depth": 45}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Emboss1", "status": "ok", "body": "F2.b0", "volume": 87089.81633974483}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure", "a": {"body": "F2.b0", "edge": "E{F4:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})|F4:side(c1[c4,c2])}"}},
    "result": {"a": {"length": 28}}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure", "a": {"body": "F2.b0", "edge": "E{F4:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})|F4:side(c2[c1,c3])}"}},
    "result": {"a": {"length": 10}}}},

  {"comment": "Taper Angle 10 deg widens it: each edge of the top moves d = 45 tan(10 deg) outwards within the top cylinder, 28 + 2 d around and 10 + 2 d along. The volume by the divergence theorem over its faces (geometry/tests/test_emboss.cpp, tapered_volume): 23766.2685714."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F4", "def": {"type": "emboss",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "face": {"body": "F2.b0", "face": "F2:side(c1)"}, "depth": 45, "taper_angle": "10 deg"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Emboss1", "status": "ok", "body": "F2.b0", "volume": 102306.0849111428}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure", "a": {"body": "F2.b0", "edge": "E{F4:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})|F4:side(c1[c4,c2])}"}},
    "result": {"a": {"length": 43.86942826376}}}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure", "a": {"body": "F2.b0", "edge": "E{F4:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})|F4:side(c2[c1,c3])}"}},
    "result": {"a": {"length": 25.86942826376}}}},

  {"comment": "-5 deg narrows it: 28 - 2 d' around and 10 - 2 d' along, d' = 45 tan(5 deg); 3809.9972453 added."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F4", "def": {"type": "emboss",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "face": {"body": "F2.b0", "face": "F2:side(c1)"}, "depth": 45, "taper_angle": "-5 deg"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Emboss1", "status": "ok", "body": "F2.b0", "volume": 82349.81358502783}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure", "a": {"body": "F2.b0", "edge": "E{F4:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})|F4:side(c1[c4,c2])}"}},
    "result": {"a": {"length": 20.12602028267}}}},

  {"comment": "-10 deg would lean the walls along the axis 2 * 45 tan(10 deg) = 15.9 together over the square's 10: the taper collapses it."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F4", "def": {"type": "emboss",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F3", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "face": {"body": "F2.b0", "face": "F2:side(c1)"}, "depth": 45, "taper_angle": "-10 deg"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Emboss1", "status": "error",
    "error_contains": "the taper collapses the profile r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}},

  {"comment": "A planar face: a 40 x 40 x 10 block (Sketch3 F5, Extrude2 F6) and on its top a 10 x 10 square (Sketch4, F7) raised 5 with Taper Angle 5 deg (Emboss2, F8): the frustum 5/3 (100 + s^2 + 10 s), s = 10 + 10 tan(5 deg), 545.020042804 added."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F5", "corner": [60, -20], "width": 40, "height": 40},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F5", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 10}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F7", "corner": [75, -5], "width": 10, "height": 10},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "emboss",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F7", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "face": {"body": "F6.b0", "face": "F6:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})"}, "depth": 5,
    "taper_angle": "5 deg"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Emboss2", "status": "ok", "body": "F6.b0", "volume": 16545.020042804}},

  {"comment": "Extrude3 (F9): the same square from 10 above its sketch, 5 with the same taper, a new body: the same solid, its top face where the emboss's is (no distance, parallel) and as large, 10.8748866 across."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F7", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "start": {"type": "offset", "offset": 10},
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 5, "taper": "5 deg"}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F9.b0", "volume": 545.020042804,
    "bbox": {"min": [74.56255668237, -5.43744331763, 10], "max": [85.43744331763, 5.43744331763, 15]}, "tolerance": 1e-6}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "measure",
      "a": {"body": "F6.b0", "face": "F8:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})"},
      "b": {"body": "F9.b0", "face": "F9:end(r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]})"}},
    "result": {"a": {"area": 118.26315932974}, "b": {"area": 118.26315932974}, "between": {"distance": 0, "angle": 0}}}}
